# =============================================
# 本地存储根目录 + 发布引擎脚本
# 子目录结构（自动创建，勿修改子目录名）:
#   {LOCAL_STORAGE_ROOT}/
#   ├── inbox/            ← 原始素材输入区（用户手动放入实拍图片）
#   ├── Pending_Content/  ← 生成内容工作区（系统读写，发布引擎读取）
#   └── archive/          ← 发布归档区（发布成功后自动移入）
#
# 注意：middleware/.env 是“每台机器各自维护”的本机配置，不要跨机器直接覆盖。
# 请按机器复制示例：
#   macOS   -> middleware/.env.mac.example
#   Windows -> middleware/.env.windows.example
#
# Windows:
#   LOCAL_STORAGE_ROOT=D:/AI-Content-Hub/content-store
#   PUBLISH_ENGINE_SCRIPT=D:/AI-Content-Hub/publish-engine/publish_engine_v40.sh
# macOS canonical repo:
#   LOCAL_STORAGE_ROOT=/Users/${USER}/workspace/ai-content-hub/workspace/content-store
#   PUBLISH_ENGINE_SCRIPT=/Users/${USER}/workspace/ai-content-hub/publish-engine/publish_engine_v40.sh
# =============================================
LOCAL_STORAGE_ROOT=D:/AI-Content-Hub/content-store
PUBLISH_ENGINE_SCRIPT=D:/AI-Content-Hub/publish-engine/publish_engine_v40.sh
